  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As <math><mn>6</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p>The required area is<br /><math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mn>6</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mn>6</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin